# The bundled Android runtime tarballs are generated build artifacts, not source.
# `paseo-node-modules-arm64.tgz` carries the official @openai/codex static musl
# binary (~212 MB uncompressed), which pushes the archive past GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file hard limit, so both runtime tarballs go through Git LFS.
# Regenerate them with scripts/prepare-android-runtime.ps1; the SHA256 digests in
# packages/manifest.txt must be updated in the same commit or the on-device
# installer rejects the payload.
ZeroTermux-main/app/src/main/assets/paseo-runtime/packages/*.tgz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
